# Vendored upstream macOS sources.
#
# The Swift/AppKit/Metal project this Linux port derives from is published here so the C kernels
# and the file format can be compared in-tree. Upstream's own repository is the place to read and
# change it, so it is marked vendored: it stays visible in the tree and in diffs, but GitHub does
# not report it as this project's language.
Compositor/**        linguist-vendored
CompositorTests/**   linguist-vendored
CompositorUITests/** linguist-vendored
Compositor.xcodeproj/** linguist-vendored
Config/**            linguist-vendored
scripts/release.sh   linguist-vendored
appcast.xml          linguist-vendored
